    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 2,
      "location": "沿岸城鎮羅德鎮(荒廢如鬼城)。強盜團洗劫,村民四散。隊伍出手相助;少女希莉亞登場。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_002",
      "title": "第二章 — 羅德鎮的強盜團"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "我們已經抵達羅德鎮了。聽說這裡是沿岸最繁榮的城鎮,我們可以在這裡歇一下,順便到酒店裡打聽一下消息.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "亞雷斯,我看你的情報有誤,這裡連半個人都沒有,倒像是座鬼城!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "好可怕.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "這可怪了,上次我和老爹來這裡買酒的時候,鎮上還熱鬧的很啊!怎麼會.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 134,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 5,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-134",
          "text": "啊!強盜來了!快逃啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "等等!我們不是強盜!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 134,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 5,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-134",
          "text": "你們不是強盜,那你們是來幹什麼的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "我們不過是路過此地,想在鎮上休息一下而已!請把事情說個清楚,說不定我們可以助各位一臂之力!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 134,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 5,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-134",
          "text": "唉!你們這些小毛頭能做什麼?窮兇極惡的強盜團預告要在此時洗劫本鎮,鎮上的人都逃光了,我們是趁人多帶走一些財物的,馬上也要逃離此地。你們也快逃吧,要是碰上了那群強盜就糟啦!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 30,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-30",
          "text": "『....!!!』"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜B",
              "speaker_slot": 11,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "呀呼!我們照預告準時抵達!咦?居然還有不怕死的沒走?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 134,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 5,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-134",
          "text": "啊!強盜來了!完啦!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜B",
              "speaker_slot": 11,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "我們不是說過,我們來的時候不准有人留在鎮上嗎?你們是活的不耐煩了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 134,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 5,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-134",
          "text": "..啊,強盜大人,請放我們一馬,以後不敢了..!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "這些強盜真猖狂啊!索爾,我們來教訓他們一頓!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "什麼教訓!不給這些傢伙悔改的機會,把他們全宰了再說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "我贊成!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜B",
              "speaker_slot": 11,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "哎呀!那群小伙子說要把我們全宰了呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜C",
              "speaker_slot": 12,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/18",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "好可怕呀!我好怕!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜B",
              "speaker_slot": 11,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0/lines/19",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "既然如此,我們就陪他們玩個兩手!上!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/5bf145f103fe/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "戰鬥中,強盜兵分兩路"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜L",
              "speaker_slot": 21,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "咦!弟兄們在幹什麼?他們早該把事情辦好了吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜M",
              "speaker_slot": 22,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "好像和別人打的正起勁呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 96,
              "speaker_name": "強盜N",
              "speaker_slot": 23,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-96",
          "text": "我看到有漏網之魚向這裡逃來呢!我們先打發了他們再說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 133,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 8,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-133",
          "text": "救命啊!這裡又有強盜出現了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "可惡,沒想到敵人居然兵分兩路....!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "不管怎樣,得想辦法搶救那些無辜的居民!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "怎麼辦呢?索爾....!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "喂!你們,往東南邊逃吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 134,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 7,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-134",
          "text": "好的!大伙兒往東南邊逃吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "奈野啊捏?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 133,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 6,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-133",
          "text": "謝謝各位的幫助,這是我們的一點小意思,請收下吧。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 133,
              "speaker_name": "村民",
              "speaker_slot": 6,
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-133",
          "text": "謝謝各位的幫助,讓我們逃過一劫。"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/5bf145f103fe/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "希莉亞登場"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "好棒!好棒!打的真漂亮!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "咦?哪裡蹦出來的野丫頭?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "說話客氣點,我可不是野丫頭,剛才你們在打的時候,我一直都躲在屋子裡看,真是看了一場好戲。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "小姐,妳的膽量可真大。有什麼我們能效勞的嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "也沒什麼啦,只是想問問你們,你們這麼好的身手,應該不只是來這裡打強盜的吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "是這樣的,我們想醫治這個女孩子的失憶症,並且送她回家。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "這是怎麼一回事呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "簡單的說,我們在森林撿到了悠妮這女孩......"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "撿?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "不對不對,是找到了悠妮,雖然失去了記憶,但是我們相信她是這馬拉大陸的人,甚至是某王國的公主也說不定,因此設法渡海送她回來。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "奇怪了,這大陸上就只有一個亞克斯王國,而這個王國的公主就...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "就怎樣?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "沒..沒什麼啦。這樣吧,我知道哪裡有人能醫治失憶症,我可以帶你們去,不過..要附帶一個條件喔!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "先說來聽聽,我們會盡量想辦法的。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "其實也很簡單,就是要帶我一起去。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "這...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "小姐,這可不是好玩的,妳一個年輕女孩子跟著我們,恐怕會倒大楣喔。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞",
              "upper": true
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "小看我的本領,你才準備倒大楣呢。怎樣?接不接受我的條件啊?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/18",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "索爾大哥,現在強盜也不知道何時會再來,把一個女孩子就這樣丟在這裡太危險了,我看還是先帶她離開的好。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯",
              "upper": false
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/19",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "是啊,索爾,悠妮的事必須盡快解決,了不起我們多為她操份心就是了。"
