          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/5bf145f103fe/scenes/2/lines/20",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好吧!不過小姐妳給我聽好,妳是負責帶路的,別給我們添麻煩。知道嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
